discovery_prompt:
List the food dishes visible in this image. Return only valid JSON — no extra text:
{"dishes":["dish name 1","dish name 2"]}
Be specific (e.g. "pad thai" not "noodles").

dish_detail_prompt:
For the dish "{{dish_name}}" visible in this image, list its ingredients with estimated gram weights. Return only valid JSON — no extra text:
{"name":"{{dish_name}}","cuisine":"string","recipe_name":"string","ingredients":[{"name":"string","amount_g":number}]}
For weights: a standard dinner plate is ~25cm, a cup is ~240ml, a fist-sized portion is ~150g. Be specific with ingredient names.
